{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio\/requirementsAA","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","externalID":"s:15OUDSFoundations15OUDSWCAG21RatioV14requirementsAASb7textual_Sb10nonTextualtvp","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requirementsAA","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WCAG21Requirements","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"requirementsAA","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Foundations"}]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"requirementsAA","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/WCAG21Requirements","text":"WCAG21Requirements","preciseIdentifier":"s:15OUDSFoundations18WCAG21Requirementsa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations","doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"WCAG 2.1 requirement for AA level needs to have textual component matching 4.5:1 contrast ratio"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and non textual component matching 3:1 contrast ratio."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is recommended for web projects."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio\/requirementsaa"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","url":"\/documentation\/oudsfoundations\/oudswcag21ratio","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some countries set up new laws so as to force companies to have a better accessibility of their digital services."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This is for example the case for France with the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/accessibilite.numerique.gouv.fr"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"also named “RGAA”."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The WCAG specifications, for AA level, defines a contrast ratio of 4.5:1 for textual elements (i.e. texts), and 3:1 for non-textual elements (i.e. link’s chevron)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However it is higly recommended for mobile devices to reach AAA level because of the screen sizes and luminosity issues, i.e. 7:1 for textual"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and 4.5:1 for non-textual elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This utility helps to define whether a set of contrast ratio matches AA and AAA or not."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"See for example "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/system.design.orange.com\/0c1af118d\/p\/2531b9-accessibility-compliance"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSWCAG21Ratio","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSFoundations\/documentation\/OUDSFoundations\/OUDSWCAG21Ratio"},"ic_layers.png":{"alt":null,"type":"image","identifier":"ic_layers.png","variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSFoundations\/ic_layers.png"}]},"doc://OUDSFoundations/documentation/OUDSFoundations/OUDSWCAG21Ratio/requirementsAA":{"title":"requirementsAA","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract